# REST

## login
POST http://localhost:1337/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": false
}
###

## Register
POST http://localhost:1337/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}
###

## Forget Password
POST http://localhost:1337/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}
###

## Profile
GET http://localhost:1337/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json